	(text "CAN termination (switched, no CAN isolation)\nR1 terminates the rocket end of the bus while the umbilical is open.\nU1 is normally closed. With the GSE plugged in, +V_EXT lights its LED\nand U1 opens, so the GSE end (120 Ohm) terminates the bus instead.\nAt separation U1 re-closes within 2 ms. The GSE must supply +V_EXT\nwhenever it is connected, else the bus has three terminations.\nR2 = 2.2k for +V_EXT = 12 V (~5 mA). 5 V: 680R; 24 V: 4.7k 0805.\nJ2.4 = rocket GND is the common CAN ground with the GSE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "46d919e6-63b9-410c-a25a-d45ceb8474ca")
	)
	(text "general can"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 97.028 109.22 0)
		(effects
