				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7fa6540b-8e97-4604-af3c-a806b723f5ca")
	)
	(text "D1: ESD protection for the exposed J2 contacts;\nplace at J2. 24 V standoff: CAN must stay < 24 V."
